  <div class="about-intro"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT STUDYHUB</p><h1>A calmer place to do school together.</h1><p class="lead">StudyHub is a not-for-profit project for students who need one clear place for classes, deadlines, project teams, and the details their LMS misses.</p><div class="about-cta"><a class="button primary" href="/">Build your desk <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a><span><i data-lucide="sparkles"></i> Made for the in-between work</span></div></div>
